---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import FormattedDate from '../components/FormattedDate.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import Title from '../components/Title.astro';

---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<Title title="Now" />
            <section class="page-content">
                <div class="page-intro">
                    <p>Current things I'm focusing on, hobbies, side quests and assorted miscellani.</p>
                    <p>Read more at <a href="https://nownownow.com/about">nownownow.com</a></p>
                </div>
                <div class="page-content-inner">
                    <h2 class="scramble">&lt;July 2026&gt;</h2>
                    <h3>Professionally</h3>
                    <p>At <a href="https://zeroheight.com">zeroheight</a>, I've been focusing hard on figuring out the zeroheight MCP, including producing loads of <a href="https://zeroheight.com/mcp/use-cases">use cases</a> and <a href="https://zeroheight.com/webinars">webinars</a> to help folks get up to speed.</p>
                    <p>I also just launched the <a href="https://zeroheight.com/maturity">Maturity Model tool</a> that I concepted and built, and planning a fair bit more around that, so it's all guns blazing. We're also deep in <a href="https://converge.zeroheight.com">Converge</a> planning for this year, which is pretty exciting. On top of that, I'm trying to hire a bloody advocate (<a href="https://apply.workable.com/zeroheight/j/A9AD6B1FE7/">UK role</a> and <a href="https://apply.workable.com/zeroheight/j/44E0FBCB31/">US role</a>) so we can get some more hands on deck and make sure I don't burn out (again).</p>
                    <h3>Side quests</h3>
                    <p><a href="https://nothingsoundsgood.club">Nothing Sounds Good</a> is still going strong (subscriptions less so), with releases from Ratsalad, The Lonely Surf, Michael Cera Palin and George Gadd + The Aftermath. Other than that, it's been a lot of Brutalligators shows, and my first year as a booker for <a href="https://indiefjord.com">Indiefjord</a>, which I also redid the website for this year.</p>
                    <h3>Personally</h3>
                    <p>It's so bloody hot in the UK right now, so I'm trying not to melt. Other than that, I've been trying to keep up the gym habit, which is hard in the heat, read way too many books, watched too many movies, and generally trying to make the most of the summer.</p>
                </div>
            </section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
